# Declaring a singleton makes this directory an explicit QML module, which
# turns OFF implicit sibling resolution — every type in here has to be listed
# or `Bar is not a type`. That is the whole reason this file has more than one
# line.
# ⚠ I18n FIRST, and it is the one singleton every other file may reach for.
# quickshell has no translator machinery, so `qsTr()` compiles and translates
# nothing; I18n.tr() reads a JSON catalog instead. See I18n.qml.
singleton I18n 1.0 I18n.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Icons 1.0 Icons.qml
singleton OsdState 1.0 OsdState.qml
singleton WidgetState 1.0 WidgetState.qml
singleton WidgetLayout 1.0 WidgetLayout.qml
singleton BarConfig 1.0 BarConfig.qml
singleton MenuState 1.0 MenuState.qml
singleton MixerState 1.0 MixerState.qml
singleton LauncherStyle 1.0 LauncherStyle.qml
singleton PostItState 1.0 PostItState.qml
singleton TuxState 1.0 TuxState.qml
singleton EqState 1.0 EqState.qml
singleton MusicLibrary 1.0 MusicLibrary.qml
singleton WeatherState 1.0 WeatherState.qml
singleton Plugins 1.0 Plugins.qml
singleton PluginHost 1.0 PluginHost.qml
singleton PluginConfig 1.0 PluginConfig.qml
SynScrollBar 1.0 SynScrollBar.qml
Bar 1.0 Bar.qml
PluginMount 1.0 PluginMount.qml
PostItFile 1.0 PostItFile.qml
Osd 1.0 Osd.qml
StartMenu 1.0 StartMenu.qml
